<div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4">
  <p>A live dashboard for the Cup, O'Reilly Auto Parts and Craftsman Truck series: running order, pace, pit stops, strategy, fuel, lap-time comparisons, race control, penalties and the Chase.</p>
  <h2>How it's built</h2>
  <p>A React front end (built for both desktop and phone) and a Hono JSON API, packaged as a single Docker container. Every push builds a new image with GitHub Actions, and it runs on my Unraid server. Sessions are saved to disk, so a restart mid-race doesn't lose anything.</p>
  <p><small class="text-zinc-500">Timing comes from NASCAR's public feeds and is unofficial.</small></p>
</div>
